# Python and build outputs
#
# ``packages/txt2crs`` is a nested workspace copied into the backend image.
# Recursive patterns keep local test, type-check, and distribution outputs out
# of that build context so the same commit always produces the same image.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.egg-info
**/.mypy_cache
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.coverage
**/htmlcov
**/.venv
**/build
**/dist

# These tracked HTML files are FastAPI runtime assets. Re-include their exact
# directory after the broad generated-build exclusion above; all other nested
# build outputs remain outside the reproducible image context.
!app/email-templates/build/
!app/email-templates/build/*.html
